    question: "What is ERP modernization with Improved365?",
    answer: "Moving from Dynamics AX 2012 or unfinished Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations environments to a clean, cloud Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations platform — with cleaner processes, integrations, and data."
  },
  {
    question: "When is ERP modernization urgent?",
    answer: "When month-end takes 4+ days, teams live in spreadsheets, multi-entity consolidation is manual, Dynamics AX 2012 infrastructure is past end-of-life, or you cannot support modern analytics because data is fragmented."
  },
  {
    question: "Is the first conversation a product demo?",
    answer: "No. We assess the limitations of your current ERP, opportunity cost of delay, and the practical path to Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations modernization — including AX 2012 upgrades when relevant."
  }
];
